  "messageType": "176",
  "name": "Court Submission",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Court Submission Transaction Set (176) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This transaction set can be used to submit a legal document or claim and supporting documentation to a court or other designated recipient. It can be transmitted to the submitter to indicate the date and docket information assigned, or it can be transmitted to the submitter to indicate claim disposition or an opinion deciding a case.",
